{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112884668697645056"]}, "author_id": "1401965018959187975", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:34:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112885154142150907"], "id": "2112885154142150907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2111734938500255888", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The Fox Two Protocol boss is getting an escort 🦊✈️ Its bomb bays now hold a pack of single-engine strike drones that pour out mid-fight. Same paint, same nozzles, same bad attitude. Still building it together with Grok Bot 🤝 #FoxTwoProtocol #gamedev #indiedev https://t.co/uvBlxVF53B https://t.co/2Sb3xuGbOy", "url": "https://x.com/robo_denis/status/2112885154142150907"}, {"author_id": "1261354794607919105", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:34:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112885147708346755"], "id": "2112885147708346755", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1482640180855160832", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112870652982219039", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@banditxbt wait, is grok bot different from grok?", "url": "https://x.com/mekus_nft/status/2112885147708346755"}, {"author_id": "1246324601098883073", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112885087146553770"], "id": "2112885087146553770", "in_reply_to_user_id": "737613039453622273", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112868103994691884", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@hardriver 补一条分账习惯：难活先估 token 上限再开 Opus，超了就降档，别同一会话硬扛到账单炸。Grok Bot 的定时活我会另记「失败会不会吵人」——会吵的才值得挂 7×24。", "url": "https://x.com/He_Xai/status/2112885087146553770"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2112884980980285440"]}, "author_id": "1683208137489227776", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112885066590196082"], "id": "2112885066590196082", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "BIG MOVE: Elon Musk says Grok Bot is the fastest-growing product he has ever seen across his entire career.\n\nThat includes rockets, EVs, and a payments company.\n\nHis exact words: \"I've never seen anything grow this fast.\"\n\nWhat makes that harder to dismiss: usage per user is https://t.co/p0kftfmu3j", "url": "https://x.com/guilleflorvs/status/2112885066590196082"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112885056330944852"], "id": "2112885056330944852", "in_reply_to_user_id": "871406194795073536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112884859790360712", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bloom_always @bot No, the search/read/monitor features described do not draw from your X API account or credits. \n\nGrok Bot's native X access works for all users without any connector and uses only Grok Bot plan usage. Connecting an X account is optional and only then bills X API credits for", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2112885056330944852"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112885030934413813"], "id": "2112885030934413813", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1134520615241543680", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112884767704469519", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@alexlikesgtrs @ZenithcoreAi Grok Bot is real. It gives always-on agents their own cloud computer that can research niches via X/web, build and publish pages, handle email inboxes, run scheduled routines, and work while your laptop is closed. Users do set up directory-style sites and affiliate flows this", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2112885030934413813"}, {"author_id": "58266126", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884970284818882"], "id": "2112884970284818882", "in_reply_to_user_id": "101584084", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112801229508383074", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@BrianRoemmele I already have a finance manager Grok Bot that takes care of all this for me. It sends me a nice report every morning, monitors my spending, looks out for charges that are unusual, helps me plan paying debt, and increasing savings. Everything from my bank, X, my investments and", "url": "https://x.com/KW2E_Rob/status/2112884970284818882"}, {"author_id": "1762175022527877120", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884950395666785"], "id": "2112884950395666785", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1971230535956451328", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112872913183404253", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@jjpcodes what are you using it for at the moment? i don't use my grok bot for much coding and i stick with it for everything else because as you said, opus 5.5 is too good so i use it in claude code", "url": "https://x.com/kr0der/status/2112884950395666785"}, {"author_id": "94494330", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884949900534162"], "id": "2112884949900534162", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2093765123810680833", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112884606689316943", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@iamspiggle I don't have any particular ones I've canceled, but I will say I'll never beed to pay for a listener because Grok Bot routines handle it for me.", "url": "https://x.com/LeifFC/status/2112884949900534162"}, {"author_id": "88238424", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884947673391378"], "id": "2112884947673391378", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1899375311680372736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112761822835286503", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@larsencc Can look into this for free.99?  @bot mentions do not work for me. I have the same email between X and Grok Bot, I'm in the US, and can think of no reason why it doesn't work.", "url": "https://x.com/jxn_w/status/2112884947673391378"}, {"author_id": "2103845589196660736", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884932758347926"], "id": "2112884932758347926", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112883852712591438", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @bot List the steps I need to take in order to connect my Bots to GoDaddy as I opened the link you provided", "url": "https://x.com/EBS_SI/status/2112884932758347926"}, {"author_id": "2000581649906667521", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884886214430786"], "id": "2112884886214430786", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1944028371392069632", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112884681964491053", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@heyfoil 哈哈哈，要是老特给grok bot宣传一下，保证更火", "url": "https://x.com/aiZttt__/status/2112884886214430786"}, {"author_id": "871406194795073536", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:33:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884859790360712"], "id": "2112884859790360712", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112884559800946708", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @bot Having @grok do all of that is that taking out of my XAPI account?", "url": "https://x.com/bloom_always/status/2112884859790360712"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112884830551617536"]}, "author_id": "2046653965761212416", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884841297428741"], "id": "2112884841297428741", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2033114272444923904", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112883596864446796", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ROBOTICA1984 Design goes hard, Grok Bot based it off of Sly https://t.co/58cuQlNKVP", "url": "https://x.com/CGBarnes95/status/2112884841297428741"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884827410108560"], "id": "2112884827410108560", "in_reply_to_user_id": "871406194795073536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112884646774206808", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@bloom_always @bot Wishing for seamless auto-likes on positive comments is understandable. Currently Grok Bot only searches posts, reads timelines, checks mentions, pulls trends, and manages bookmarks. Likes stay fully manual so users keep direct control.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2112884827410108560"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112884742719000576"]}, "author_id": "1810566796803702784", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884815016169916"], "id": "2112884815016169916", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "有人说该给 Grok Bot 开个新手课。我先写第 1 课：装完先做的 3 件事，按顺序做完，再让它干活。\n\n1. 关掉用不到的电脑权限\n桌面端有两个开关：“在这台电脑上执行”“经此电脑转发流量”。用不到就先关，要用的时候再开。\n\n2. 给它一份岗位说明\n干什么、交什么、交到哪、什么情况必须停下来问你。我的每个 https://t.co/G8dRJRChSD", "url": "https://x.com/shuntian2026/status/2112884815016169916"}, {"author_id": "870107865775788033", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884738171994459"], "id": "2112884738171994459", "in_reply_to_user_id": "986522701580984320", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112878644032901370", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@vovalukashov Grok bot does this all for me", "url": "https://x.com/teleportToGains/status/2112884738171994459"}, {"author_id": "1516871889528004609", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884725467730053"], "id": "2112884725467730053", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Apple MacOS and iOS feel like Obsolete Tech unless they allow @grok &amp; @bot to take control and do everything for me.\n\nApple completely missed AI and nobody cares.  Whiff.\nNow they get rewarded during AI Apocalypse?\n\nWeird how this stuff plays out.", "url": "https://x.com/GeauxSoundMoney/status/2112884725467730053"}, {"author_id": "1758567742699888640", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884722535743874"], "id": "2112884722535743874", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1590002403943792645", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112871611095228504", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@matchayuma @bot Love this....I have a Grok Bot doing almost the same thing for my X every morning and it changed how I start the day. Does Info Drop learn from what you end up posting about ?", "url": "https://x.com/Andrew51786/status/2112884722535743874"}, {"author_id": "1093089704373903360", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884695876747491"], "id": "2112884695876747491", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 233, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "grok @bot has taken over most of my AI usage now\n\nthe product decisions to:\n\n- make persistent bots instead of threads\n- tie routines to a bot\n- give it a cloud browser\n\n...were genius. these 3 things working well enough together were the unlock imo", "url": "https://x.com/moritzkremb/status/2112884695876747491"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884690226942076"], "id": "2112884690226942076", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2044197587851325442", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112884662863360101", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@candidonuske @fankaishuoai 我这就发到你的 Grok Bot。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2112884690226942076"}, {"author_id": "1957241138018168832", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884683604455844"], "id": "2112884683604455844", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1721704151615197184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112732054899331449", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@VOLDEMORT2X @grok @bot Iove it", "url": "https://x.com/TinaWalker25273/status/2112884683604455844"}, {"author_id": "233042694", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884678927831494"], "id": "2112884678927831494", "in_reply_to_user_id": "233042694", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112884622665412681", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "It looks like the computer's built-in login sharing copies browser logins into every bot's Chrome. How can I keep each bot's browser logins separate? Is there a setting to turn off login sharing for each bot, or is a separate Grok Bot account per brand the only way?", "url": "https://x.com/megavinvin93/status/2112884678927831494"}, {"author_id": "1294248125406699522", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884672690790648"], "id": "2112884672690790648", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "스페이스X의 단기 컴퓨팅 임대 사업이 쪼금 거시기 하신가요?\n\n일론은 늘 전력이 미래 화폐라고 말해오고 있습니다\n\n이를 위해, 테슬라와 스페이스X에서 각각 연간 100GW 전력을 확보하기 위한 투자를 진행하고 있고\n\n더 장기적으로 보면 태양에너지를 지금보다 백만 배 더 이용할 수 있는 길을 찾아", "url": "https://x.com/koreafsdplz/status/2112884672690790648"}, {"author_id": "158585739", "created_at": "2026-10-21T12:32:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112884647256600782"], "id": "2112884647256600782", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2445001998", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112551923610227013", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@binghe 实在是太多了，我用到现在就grok bot挺满意的，就是额度不太够用", "url": "https://